    "the trained gallery holds no photo of it, which makes that car an open-set",
    "query: any confident answer for it is wrong.",
    "",
    "Used by `python -m train.packaged_check`. See CLAUDE.md, Recognition →",
    "Can a car be recognised through its packaging?"
